 # Changelog

+

+## 0.4.0 - 2026-10-08

+

+### Added

+

+- Reworked Project creation into a Project Setup workflow.

+- Require a project name when creating a project.

+- Allow an initial KML, KMZ, DXF, or DWG file to be linked during project creation.

+- Automatically extract Land boundary, area, perimeter, centroid, water source, and imported sectors when supported.

+- Add Project cards for Land, Owner, Configuration, Rules, and Tree Plan.

+- Add Project setup completion tracking and draft/ready status.

+- Add DXF parsing through `ezdxf`.

+

+### Changed

+

+- Project detail now uses database counts instead of loading all geometry/tree documents.

+- Preserve uploaded DWG files while clearly marking that geometry extraction requires conversion.

+- Store Project setup data in structured project fields for later Geometry/Hydrology/Trees/Report workflows.

+

+### Fixed

+

+- Reject empty Project names.

+- Validate manual water-source coordinates and closed manual boundaries.

+- Make project deletion verify ownership before deleting dependent data.

+

